//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - key / graph id / operation ordinalはoperation ownerと照合するidentityであり、spanからoperation kindやendpointを推測しません。
//: - spanはRust ResourceOp全variantが持つspanのselfhost非負i32投影です。block spanとのsame-file/containmentは要求しません。
struct SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceIrOperationSpanInventoryRecord:
    key %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheProofKey
    graph_id %SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceGraphId
    operation_ordinal %i32
    span %SelfhostSourceSpan

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceIrOperationSpanInventory: ResourceOp spanのowner table
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - legacy HIR classifier fixtureとは別に所有し、dummy spanをproduction Resource IR provenanceとして扱いません。
struct SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceIrOperationSpanInventory:
    records %Vec SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceIrOperationSpanInventoryRecord

//: SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceIrOperationKind: Rust ResourceOp の top-level variant
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - Rust modelの24 variantをfallbackなしで保持します。Branch / Loop / Match内部の再帰topologyと各variantのpayloadは後続段階です。
enum SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheResourceIrOperationKind:
    Expr
    DeclareLocal
    Read
    Assign
    Borrow
    Move
    Drop
    EndScope
    CallEffect
    FunctionValue
    Call
    IndirectCall
    RawMemory
    RawAddressAlias
    RawAddressView
    StorageOrigin
    CollectionSlotLifecycle
    CollectionStorageRelocate
    CollectionSlotDropTraversal
    CollectionSlotTransformRange
    Construct
    Branch
    Loop
    Match

